# SCOPE 1  |  minima, re-optimised to TightOpt and analysed by FREQ at the Tier 2 level
# State: H2O reference  |  register row: h2o-T2-V02
# Why: the Tier 2 reference zero. Cheap (seconds) but must exist at the same level and
#      grid as everything else, and must carry ZPE + Gibbs corrections.
# Gate: ORCA TERMINATED NORMALLY, THE OPTIMIZATION HAS CONVERGED, 0 imaginary modes.

! B3LYP D3BJ def2-TZVP RIJCOSX def2/J TightSCF DefGrid3 Opt Freq TightOpt

%pal nprocs 4 end
%maxcore 3000

%scf
  MaxIter 300
end

%freq
  Temp 298.15, 1003.15
end

* xyzfile 0 1 xyz/h2o.xyz
